    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26394" root="طجن" body-key="T">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَجْنٌ</span></b>  The act of <i>frying:</i> (K:) an adventitious word in the Arabic language. (TA.)
You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَجَنَ الشَّىْءَ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَجُنَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَجْنٌ</span>, <i>He
fried the thing.</i> (TK.)

